Package: robscale
Type: Package
Title: Faster Robustness: Accelerated Estimation of Location and Scale
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Dennis Alexis Valin", family = "Dittrich",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "davd@economicscience.net",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4438-8276")))
Description: A comprehensive suite of high-performance robust scale and
    location estimators. Provides logistic M-estimators, the 'Qn' and 'Sn'
    scale estimators of Rousseeuw & Croux (1993), the Gini mean difference,
    scaled MAD and IQR, unbiased standard deviation, and a variance-weighted
    ensemble that adaptively combines all estimators. Leverages
    platform-specific SIMD vectorization and Intel Threading Building Blocks
    (TBB) parallelism for speedups of 2-39x over existing implementations.
    A unified dispatcher ('scale_robust') automatically selects the optimal
    estimator based on sample size. Replaces 'revss' with an 'Rcpp' backend.
